DESCRIPTION:BXP presents\nHoliday Market at Embarcadero Center\nWednesday\
 , November 18 | Urban Patio\, Three Embarcadero Center\n\nSan Francisco\, 
 it's time to get into the holiday spirit!\n\nHead to Embarcadero Center on
  Wednesday\, November 18 from 4-6pm for an evening of festive fun\, local 
 shopping\, live music\, seasonal bites\, and holiday drinks. The Holiday M
 arket takes over the Urban Patio at Three Embarcadero Center with local ve
 ndors\, family-friendly activities\, and a festive celebration to welcome 
 the holiday season.\n\nAt the heart of the event is Embarcadero Center's 4
 0th Annual Building Lighting\, bringing 17\,000 twinkling lights to the Sa
 n Francisco skyline.\n\nAnd here's a reason to show up early: the first 40
 0 guests will receive a complimentary drink token or food voucher!\n\nAdmi
 ssion is FREE and open to all ages\, with entry available on a first-come\
 , first-served basis. Alcohol consumption is 21+ with valid ID.\n\nRSVP NO
 W!\n\nFree\nBXP presents\n\nTickets: https://consumer.pxf.io/APvP5J?u=http
