DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Holiday Cheese Board Workshop at Book Passage in
  Corte Madera on Thursday\, November 19\, 2026\, from 5:00 to 7:00 PM.\nTh
 is hands-on workshop covers the art of building a cheese board. You’ll l
 earn to craft displays using cheeses from MALT-protected farms—Point Rey
 es Farmstead Cheese Co.\, Toluma Farms’ Tomales Farmstead Creamery\, and
  Nicasio Valley Cheese Co.—paired with local accoutrements and seasonal 
 items\, rosemary from Hicks Mountain Belvedere Ranch and lavender from Poi
 nt Reyes Lavender Co.\nSupport local Marin County food producers while lea
 rning tips to host your holiday table.\n\nMALT provides the cheese\, accou
 trements\, and to-go ware for free—please bring your own board (BYOB) an
 d consider a gift to support MALT!\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://bookpassage
 .com/event/holiday-cheese-board-workshop\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com
 /free-build-holiday-cheese-board-class-local-marin-cheeses-north-bay/\nSou
 rce: Funcheap SF
