DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerKingmakers of OaklandGolden St
 ate Music and Technology Program Preview\nJoin Kingmakers of Oakland\, Gol
 den State Entertainment\, the Golden State Warriors\, and NBA 2K to learn 
 all about our upcoming 12-week music programs. If you are an Oakland stude
 nt aged 14 – 24 that’s passionate about beatmaking\, DJing\, or writin
 g lyrics\, this is your exclusive opportunity to get a firsthand feel for 
 the program before the cycle kicks off in January.\nWhat to Expect Facilit
 ator Introductions:\n\nConnect directly with our expert instructors and in
 dustry mentors to ask questions and learn about the specific skills you wi
 ll develop.\nMini-Workshop Samplers: Jump into hands-on breakout sessions 
 covering beatmaking\, lyric writing\, and DJing to experience exactly what
  the program offers.\nStudio Tours: Step inside the state-of-the-art KOO L
 abs Design Center and Production House and explore our professional record
 ing studios and live room sound stage.\nCommunity & Refreshments: Enjoy li
 ght snacks while networking with program leaders and your future creative 
 peers.\nApply On-Site & Secure Your Spot Attendees will receive priority a
 ccess to complete and submit their program applications directly on-site f
 or the January launch. RSVP today to lock in your spot\nWe’ll also be ra
 ffling off some SIGNED WARRIORS ITEMS to event attendees!\n\nFree\n\nTicke
 ts: https://partiful.com/e/nl7HMbi57O6GQF8ns1jl\nDetails: https://sf.funch
 eap.com/golden-state-music-technology-program-preview/\nSource: Funcheap S
 F
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/GSE-Ev
 ent-Flyer.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261118T115305Z
LOCATION:KOO Labs Design Center and Production House\, 1035 7th Street Oak
 land\, CA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/golden-state-music-technology-program-preview/
END:VEVENT
