BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Art Of Tea Closing Party: Hidden Teapots + Live Jazz
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T210000
DTSTAMP:20261118T115305Z
UID:funcheap-1645257@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Eating Drinking
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerARTdeezine\n\nTHE ART OF TEA C
 LOSING PARTY\nCelebrate the final night of THE ART OF TEA exhibition at HU
 NT & GATHER Gallery\, where a teapot hides in every painting.\nFriday\, No
 vember 20 | 6:00 to 9:00 PM | $95 | 21+ | Limited to 40 guests\n\nGet Tick
 ets\n\nEvery painting in Laine Wiesemann’s The Art of Tea hides a teapot
 . Join us for a closing reception with live jazz\, bubbly\, blooms\, and a
  tea tower\, all in the gallery.\n\nYour ticket includes:\n\nA welcome gla
 ss of bubbly (sparkling wine or alcohol-free sparkling tea)\, with more sp
 arkling wine flowing through the first hour\nLive jazz trio\nCharcuterie a
 nd passed bites\nA talk with the artist about her work\nA flower bouquet y
 ou build yourself at our flower bar\nYour own signature tea blend\, packag
 ed and labeled to gift or keep\nA seated tea tower with a guided tea tasti
 ng led by our tea expert\n\nHow the night goes:\nArrive to bubbly and musi
 c\, meet Laine\, and hunt for her hidden teapots. Make your bouquet and bl
 end your tea. At 7:00\, sit down for the tea tower and tasting. Then wande
 r\, circle back to anything you missed\, and linger over live jazz and a d
 rink from the bar.\nThe art is for sale\nClosing night is your last chance
  to take a piece of the ART OF TEA exhibition home from HUNT & GATHER Gall
 ery.\nDrinks from the bar are available for purchase in the final hour. 21
 +\nHunt & Gather/Sol Botanica Bar\n1355 Market Street\, inside The Market\
 nTickets: $95\n\n$95.00\n\nTickets: https://huntandgathersf.com/the-art-of
 -tea-closing-party-nov-20-2026/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/2026-art
 -tea-closing-party-hidden-teapots-live-jazz-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Art-of
 -tea-closing-blog.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261118T115305Z
LOCATION:Sol Botanica\, 1355 Market Street
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/2026-art-tea-closing-party-hidden-teapots-live
 -jazz-sf/
END:VEVENT
