DESCRIPTION:Civic Center Community Benefit DistrictGet ready to kick off t
 he holiday season at San Francisco’s Civic Center Plaza Holiday Tree Lig
 hting 2026!\nFor over 100 years an illuminated tree has stood in San Franc
 isco’s Civic Center Plaza during the holidays. This year be a part of th
 e tradition at the annual San Francisco Civic Center Plaza Tree Lighting o
 n Wednesday\, December 2\, 4-7pm!\nThe event also features “snow” flur
 ries\, where kids (and kids at heart) can twirl and dance through the fall
 ing snow\, while in the Makers Village enjoy holiday-themed activities wit
 h SF Etsy and a children’s book giveaway from the SF Public Library.\nCi
 vic Center Tree Lighting\nWednesday\, December 2\, 2026 | 4-7p\nCivic Cent
 er Plaza\, 335 McAllister St\, SF\nFREE – All ages | Bites will be avail
 able for purchase\, along with a full bar featuring seasonal favorites.\nH
 appening rain or shine\; The Tree Lighting takes place across from an illu
 minated City Hall in Civic Center Plaza and begins promptly at 4pm\, with 
 the lighting of Civic Center’s 50-foot noble fir at 5:30pm.\nThe night
 ’s lineup of entertainment includes:\n\nThe Tap Dancing Christmas Trees\
 nThe San Francisco Boys Chorus\nThe Grinch\, Mrs. Claus and\nThe VIP-of-th
 e-hour: Santa!\nWith the night of performances led by the Master of Ceremo
 nies: award-winning performer Rotimi Agbabiaka.\n\nCivic Center CBD\n\nCiv
 ic Center CBD\n\nCivic Center CBD\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eventbri
 te.com/e/civic-center-plaza-holiday-tree-lighting-2026-tickets-20038368479
 54?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-civic-center-t
 ree-lighting-50foot-fir-santa-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Civic-
 Center-CBD-illuminatedtree.jpg
